    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple Roguelike Deckbuilder inspired by other genre games designed for faster runs</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic approach based on Artefact system and upgrading cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combination of Active and Passive Artefacts to get out of various situations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381320/extras/471fd5e336c2112565e58c8b331ebd8f.poster.avif?t=1750957919\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381320/extras/471fd5e336c2112565e58c8b331ebd8f.webm?t=1750957919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381320/extras/471fd5e336c2112565e58c8b331ebd8f.mp4?t=1750957919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381320/extras/70a1211ab73c358912f29e9a7fe21b73.poster.avif?t=1750957919\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381320/extras/70a1211ab73c358912f29e9a7fe21b73.webm?t=1750957919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381320/extras/70a1211ab73c358912f29e9a7fe21b73.mp4?t=1750957919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Wheel of Fortune System</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin for Gold, HP or Random Artefact you own</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most rewards are positive with exception of Curses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No option to decline won Cards and Artefacts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Possible to win less coins than invested</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First spin at each event upgrades next Wheel quality until epic, then resets</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple consecutive events possible for quick progression</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Node Map System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random Generated Map featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normal Encounter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elite Encounter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss Encounter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shop (with refresh option)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treasure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wheel of Fortune events</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playable Characters</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Archer: Aggressive character, Can summon pet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mage: Cunning character, Can be tricky to play, Conjuring orbs as resource</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paladin: Robust character with healing and damage reflection</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple Roguelike Deckbuilder inspired by other genre games designed for faster runs</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic approach based on Artefact system and upgrading cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combination of Active and Passive Artefacts to get out of various situations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381320/extras/471fd5e336c2112565e58c8b331ebd8f.poster.avif?t=1750957919\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381320/extras/471fd5e336c2112565e58c8b331ebd8f.webm?t=1750957919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381320/extras/471fd5e336c2112565e58c8b331ebd8f.mp4?t=1750957919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381320/extras/70a1211ab73c358912f29e9a7fe21b73.poster.avif?t=1750957919\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381320/extras/70a1211ab73c358912f29e9a7fe21b73.webm?t=1750957919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381320/extras/70a1211ab73c358912f29e9a7fe21b73.mp4?t=1750957919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Wheel of Fortune System</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin for Gold, HP or Random Artefact you own</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most rewards are positive with exception of Curses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No option to decline won Cards and Artefacts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Possible to win less coins than invested</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First spin at each event upgrades next Wheel quality until epic, then resets</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple consecutive events possible for quick progression</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Node Map System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random Generated Map featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normal Encounter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elite Encounter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss Encounter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shop (with refresh option)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treasure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wheel of Fortune events</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playable Characters</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Archer: Aggressive character, Can summon pet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mage: Cunning character, Can be tricky to play, Conjuring orbs as resource</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paladin: Robust character with healing and damage reflection</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
